QC (Quality Control) — Finding defects in the product

  Detective / Reactive — "Is there a bug?"

  In our demo, QC is:
  - Running npm test and seeing TC-09 fail — we found the discount bug
  - Writing test cases (TC-01 to TC-13) and executing them
  - Manually testing the app, applying SAVE20 coupon, noticing total is wrong
  - Writing the defect report (slide 18 template)

  ▎ QC asks: "Does this work correctly?"

  ---
  QA (Quality Assurance) — Processes that prevent defects

  Preventive / Proactive — "How do we stop bugs from happening?"

  In our demo, QA would be:
  - Having a code review checklist — reviewer would catch that discount is computed but never used
  - Setting up npm test as a CI/CD gate — code can't merge if tests fail
  - Defining a rule: "every function must have unit tests before PR approval"
  - The test case design process itself (slide 16) — planning what to test before testing

  ▎ QA asks: "What process would have prevented this bug?"

  ---
  QE (Quality Engineering) — Building quality into the system

  Systemic / Engineering approach — "How do we automate and scale quality?"

  In our demo, QE would be:
  - The test automation framework itself (Jest + RTL setup)
  - npm run test:coverage generating coverage metrics automatically
  - Automating tests in a CI pipeline (slide 26) — lint → unit → integration → deploy
  - Setting quality thresholds: "coverage must be > 80%, fail the build otherwise"

  ▎ QE asks: "How do we engineer the system so bugs can't reach production?"

  ---
  One-liner summary

  ┌─────┬──────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │     │      Focus       │                    In our demo                    │
  ├─────┼──────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ QC  │ Find bugs        │ TC-09 catches the discount bug                    │
  ├─────┼──────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ QA  │ Prevent bugs     │ Code review checklist would have caught it        │
  ├─────┼──────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ QE  │ Automate quality │ Jest + coverage + CI pipeline ensures it at scale │
  └─────┴──────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
